+<main>
+<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="page-title"><div class="eyebrow">Simple, honest pricing</div><h1 id="page-title">Good conversations.<br>Clear pricing.</h1><p>Everything your team needs to stay in sync—without the noise.</p><div class="billing" role="group" aria-label="Billing frequency"><button type="button" id="monthly" aria-pressed="true">Monthly</button><button type="button" id="yearly" aria-pressed="false">Yearly <span class="saving">−20%</span></button></div><div class="billing-note" id="billing-note" aria-live="polite">Billed monthly. Change plans any time.</div></section>
+<section class="plans wrap" aria-label="Pricing plans">
+<article class="card"><h2>Free</h2><p class="desc">A better way to bring your small team together.</p><div class="price-line"><span class="currency">$</span><span class="amount">0</span><span class="period">/ user / month</span></div><p class="per-user">Free forever</p><hr class="rule"><p class="includes">The essentials</p><ul class="features"><li><span class="check">✓</span>Unlimited messages</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Up to 10 team members</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>1:1 audio and video calls</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>10 GB shared storage</li></ul><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Start%20with%20Relay%20Free">Get started free</a></article>
