+<section class="faq-section wrap" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">The fine print, simplified</div><h2 id="faq-title">Questions? Answered.</h2><p>Still wondering? <a href="mailto:hello@relay.example">We’re happy to help.</a></p></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Can I try Relay before I pay?</summary><p>Absolutely. The Team plan comes with a 14-day free trial, with no credit card required. Or start on Free and upgrade whenever you’re ready.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing and you’ll save 20% per user. The displayed monthly equivalent is billed annually as one payment. You can switch your billing preference any time.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change or cancel my plan?</summary><p>Yes. Upgrade, downgrade, or cancel whenever you need to. There are no contracts or cancellation fees, and your team keeps access through the end of its billing period.</p></details><details><summary>What counts as a user?</summary><p>Each active member of your Relay workspace is a user. You can invite or remove members from your workspace settings, and your plan adjusts to your team.</p></details><details><summary>Is my team’s data secure?</summary><p>Relay encrypts data in transit and at rest. Business adds advanced administrative controls and dedicated support for teams with additional requirements.</p></details></div></section>
+</main><footer class="footer"><div class="wrap"><span>© 2025 Relay. Better work, together.</span><a href="mailto:hello@relay.example">Questions? Get in touch</a></div></footer>
+<script>
+(() => {
+  const monthly = document.getElementById('monthly');
+  const yearly = document.getElementById('yearly');
+  const note = document.getElementById('billing-note');
+  function setBilling(isYearly) {
+    monthly.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(!isYearly));
+    yearly.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(isYearly));
+    document.querySelectorAll('.amount[data-monthly]').forEach(price => {
+      price.textContent = price.dataset[isYearly ? 'yearly' : 'monthly'];
+    });
+    document.querySelectorAll('.per-user[data-copy-monthly]').forEach(copy => {
+      copy.textContent = copy.dataset[isYearly ? 'copyYearly' : 'copyMonthly'];
+    });
+    note.textContent = isYearly ? 'Billed annually. Save 20% compared to monthly.' : 'Billed monthly. Change plans any time.';
+  }
+  monthly.addEventListener('click', () => setBilling(false));
+  yearly.addEventListener('click', () => setBilling(true));
+})();
+</script>
